],
"(1) Losing your sole VH means immediate scenario end;": [
"Scenario/NVC08_i.txt"
],
"(1) Use Special Forces to capture VHs on islands!": [
"Scenario/NVC10_i.txt"
],
"(1) You must resist to the initial assault, losing the VH means immediate scenario end;": [
"Scenario/NVC07_i.txt"
],
"(2) Use wisely aircrafts to destroy the Japanese Navy!": [
"Scenario/NVC10_i.txt"
],
"(2) You are allowed to deploy your CORE units ONLY via the support unit, do not lose it!;": [
"Scenario/NVC08_i.txt"
],
"(2) You have at your disposal only your CORE units, there is no deployment hex but only a support unit, if you lose it the scenario is lost since no deployment is then possible...": [
"Scenario/NVC12_i.txt"
],
"(2) You will be allowed to deploy your CORE units only when the support unit will arrive as a reinforcement unit;": [
"Scenario/NVC07_i.txt"
],
"(3) A hidden VH is located underneath a sea mine, find the good one and occupy the hex. Use the bombers as support against the Vietnamese navy!                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       ": [
"Scenario/NVC08_i.txt"
],
"(3) Spare your air points to heliport to enemy hills the reinforcement units coming from the North. ": [
