],
"* 2 Players means that you'll have more fun playing this Scenario against human, rather than against computer. This basically because PeG's AI is really, really stupid :) ": [
"Userscen/Siege of Sarajevo READ ME.txt"
],
"* Remember that currently, People's General custom scenarios will only appear in the game if you navigate to the program's start file in the install directory and run it from there with a double click. Using the desktop icon or the Autoplay start up on the CD may hide any custom scenarios. Although using a desktop shortcut to my People's General .exe works fine for me.": [
"Userscen/Siege of Sarajevo READ ME.txt"
