],
"Chien thang! For now your men have reached all the objectives.  At dawn you should expect new orders from the central office.  Then we will decide on a course of action.": [
"Scenario/NVC00_bv.TXT"
],
"Chinese 'Qing Lian' Campaign - 2014-2016": [
"Scenario/NVC.txt"
],
"Chinese forces are now trying to mobilize their reserves into defending their borders, fearing an offensive on their country.": [
"Scenario/Khabarovsk1v.txt"
],
"Chinese invasion of Siberia caught the world's attention.": [
"Scenario/RED_viet.txt"
],
"Churchill 2 prototype.  This was a nice tank to have and was responsible for quite a few kills.  I now have three tanks, six artillery, two helos, a Mirage 6000, one Eurosam, two Roland 2s, two AMX Vectra recons, and the rest all infantry.": [
"Scenario/ns4PlayNotes.txt"
],
"Comrade commander!  I'm a representative of Bejing, where your exploits have caused a lot of excitement and national pride.  My orders are to tell you that Bejing has decided that you will be appointed as Commander of the Joint Chieff of Staff including the People's Republic Army of China and Mongolia.": [
"Scenario/NVC01_bv.TXT"
],
"Congratulations comrade!  You have completely smashed the enemy troops, but there is no time to rest since we must continue the offensive.  Your command must drive to the south.  Continued good luck!": [
"Scenario/NVC07_bv.TXT"
],
"Congratulations general, Ho Chi Minh has been liberated! The Chinese flag has been raised over Independence Palace.  The Vietnamese general Doung Van Minh has surrendered to us. It is time to inspect the embassies of supporting countries of our enemy (Japan, Malysia, South Korea, ...)": [
"Scenario/NVC10_bv.TXT"
],
"Contact me: nigel@cloutt.fslife.co.uk": [
"Userscen/Readme.txt"
],
"Craig lindemann - Seii Taisho Gun on the Forum boards": [
"Userscen/Land Reclamation_README.txt"
],
"Disaster is a word that does not even begin to capture the extent of damage that your defeat in Vietnam has caused. The world press is denouncing the invasion as wanton aggression, and opinions at home are little better. The nations of Southeast Asia must now resign themselves to subjugation by the People’s Republic of China. Your own resignation is expected forthwith.": [
"Scenario/SAIGON1L.TXT"
],
"Do not expect huge resistance at night!": [
"Scenario/NVC00_i.txt"
],
"Due to an energical counterattack we have been forced to retreat, but now is the time to reconquer the lost territory. ": [
"Scenario/NVC01_i.txt"
],
"Due to your services in the past you are not sent to a military court...": [
"Scenario/NVC12_l.TXT"
],
"During the Vietnamese War in 1965 Vietname conquered a US Base Camp which became a strong military base in the meantime.": [
"Scenario/NVC02_i.txt"
],
"Enemy air assets wreaked some havoc killing off one or two units. ": [
"Scenario/ns4PlayNotes.txt"
],
"Excellent, the remanants of the Pakistani army are fleeing in dissaray to their homeland!": [
"Scenario/IND2bv.TXT"
],
"Expect a tougher resistance since Pakistanis are fighting now home...": [
"Scenario/IND_03_i.txt"
],
"Failure, even in a secondary objective, finds no forgiveness in war. The Americans have exploited the opening your defeat provided, and the strength of their air power has effected a general retreat. All our forces are pulling back into Manchuria. You, however, will not be trusted with even that command.": [
"Scenario/SAKHALIN2l.TXT"
],
"Falcon's Gambit: The 2001 Korean War": [
"Scenario/nspegu001i.txt"
],
"Following the Formosa Incident, United States of America declared war on China.": [
"Scenario/RED_china.txt"
],
"Following the liberation of Thailand, we have pursued the last remnants of their imperialist army to the border with Myanmar. Their burmanese allies are plotting against our great nation along side our american and japanese foes. ": [
"Scenario/RED_Rangi.txt"
],
"For too long the island of Formosa has been set aside by the former rulers of China. Their so called Taiwanese Republic must cease to exist. The dialectic demands it and you've have been chosen to lead our people army to victory.": [
"Scenario/RED_Taipeic_i.txt"
],
"Game exe file to start this campaign: \"PeG030RDIndia.exe\" (based on PeG 3.0)": [
"Scenario/IND.txt"
],
"General, this is our second attempt to prevent Pakistan from imposing by force and manipulation the so-called reunification with Bangladesh!": [
"Scenario/IND_04_i.txt"
],
"General, you must seize Hainoi as quickly as you can!": [
"Scenario/NVC11_i.txt"
],
"Good job commander, Pakistani have learnt how dangerous it is to attack our homeland!": [
"Scenario/IND1bv.TXT"
],
"Good news, we are officially supported by Russia who will assist us in case Chinese forces dare to intervene again!": [
"Scenario/IND_04_i.txt"
],
"However even if we managed to avoid the intervention of North Korea (they remember our help in 1951) USA has requested the intervention of South Korea, Japan and Malaysia.": [
"Scenario/NVC05_i.txt"
],
"However the goeal of our intervention has been reached: the rebellion has been crushed once and for all!": [
"Scenario/NVC12_bv.TXT"
],
"However, we are in need of you elsewhere. It is time to focus our offensive on Russia.": [
"Scenario/RED_Taipeicv.txt"
],
"I finally overstrengthened some of my units.  That helped.": [
"Scenario/ns4PlayNotes.txt"
],
"I pushed heavily on the right and on the left, with most of the weight going to the right.  I put very little down the center.": [
"Scenario/ns4PlayNotes.txt"
],
"I upgraded one of my Leopard 2A5s to a new Tiger tank.  :)  That came in handy as the Tiger, the Churchill 2, the two helos and my F-22 were able to whittle down the otherwise formidable Chinese opposition.": [
"Scenario/ns4PlayNotes.txt"
],
"If our offensive is a major success then the ancient order will be restored and peace talks could begin.": [
"Scenario/IND_03_i.txt"
],
"If we win this campaign I promise you we shall invade Japan!": [
"Scenario/NVC05_i.txt"
],
"If you have any questions, advice, praise, or criticism, my e-mail address is: adol@lombardiacom.it ": [
"Userscen/Siege of Sarajevo READ ME.txt"
],
"In a matter of hours the insolence of this country will be no longer a problem!": [
"Scenario/NVC00_i.txt"
],
"In the meantime we cannot let this provocation unpunished!": [
"Scenario/IND_01_i.txt"
],
"In this folder will be added the usermade scenarios.": [
"Userscen/info.txt"
],
"It is to be here that we launch the re-conquest of Siberia and the Russian Far East.  A humiliated Russia, ready for vengeance, needs only a spark of hope to rejoin the effort to free Asia.": [
"Scenario/RED_Chir1i.txt",
"Scenario/Volgograd1i.TXT"
],
"It is unfortunate that Americans chose to involve themselves in our domestic problems. We'll need to teach them a lesson.": [
"Scenario/RED_Taipeicv.txt"
],
"It was very interesting starting this scenario out with Japanese, German, French, British and Italian equipment in addition to the South Korean equipment instead of playing it the usual way with American and South Korean equipment.": [
"Scenario/ns4PlayNotes.txt"
],
"It's time to get back to the jungle. In most places our offensive has been stopped and the enemy has recovered sooner than we thought possible.": [
"Scenario/NVC08_bv.TXT"
],
"Kirby's AD Theorem came to fruition as my 11 strength leader Eurosam got picked off in spite of having two adjacent AD units.  And that was with only two enemy Wild Weasel air missions.  The temptation to reload was great, but I subsumed it.": [
"Scenario/ns4PlayNotes.txt"
],
"Land Reclaimation is a copyrighted by": [
"Userscen/Land Reclamation_README.txt"
],
"Led by American forces, the United Nations attempt to halt the People's Republic of China and North Korea in South Korea.  The North Koreans and their allies are preparing to unleash a massive attack to reunite the Korean penninsula once and for all.": [
"Scenario/nspegu001i.txt"
],
"Led by American forces, the United Nations attempt to halt the People's Republic of China in Siberia.": [
"Scenario/USc.TXT"
],
"Led by American forces, the United Nations attempt to halt the People's Republic of China in South East Asia then continue to free the Chinese 'satellites.'": [
"Scenario/USb.TXT"
],
"Led by American forces, the United Nations attempt to halt the People's Republic of China in South Korea.": [
"Scenario/USc2.TXT"
],
"Losing 'Phuoc-Hai' city means immediate arrest. You familly will have the patriotic duty to pay the invoice of the bullet in your head!": [
"Scenario/NVC01_i.txt"
],
"Lost a leader when Chinese tanks and a helo killed my best recon, but gained two other leaders.": [
"Scenario/ns4PlayNotes.txt"
],
"Lost yet another Eurosam on T5.  What is that?  About six lost so far?  That must be half of my core units.": [
"Scenario/ns4PlayNotes.txt"
],
"Maybe our claims at the United Nations will be heard and will bring some military support...": [
"Scenario/IND.txt"
],
"More Detailed storyline on scenario description in game.": [
"Userscen/Readme.txt"
],
"Mutual artillery support saved at least two artillery units.": [
"Scenario/ns4PlayNotes.txt"
],
"My Eurofighter Typhoons were everywhere on defense, wild weasel and strike missions and certainly earned their keep.": [
"Scenario/ns4PlayNotes.txt"
],
"My European Intervention Force has geled rather well.  The tanks and artillery are working in tandem with air assets and infantry.  ": [
"Scenario/ns4PlayNotes.txt"
],
"My artillery did well, as usual, with the GCTs working nicely with the AS-90s, the PzH 2000 and the Wegmann LARS purchased during the scenario.  One of my Leopard 2A5s was savaged by Chinese tanks, and that really surprised me.  Still, everywhere else, I applied consistent, yet incredibly not-dazzling pressure on the enemy to obtain a V in about 9 or 10 turns.": [
"Scenario/ns4PlayNotes.txt"
],
"My eastern flank got stalled by the hard-hitting Chinese infantry attacks which the Chinese do so well in this jungle terrain.  But the western flank kept moving like an avalance gathering speed on an oily slope.": [
"Scenario/ns4PlayNotes.txt"
],
"My thanks to Pat Fitzgibbon \"patf420\" for helping me \"see\" how to do this.  And thanks to": [
"Userscen/Eome2_README.txt"
],
"NATO forces were also destroyed and they retreated from Russia altogether.": [
"Scenario/RED_Chircv.txt"
],
