"Tot cong viec general!, with meager resources you have achieved all the objectives.  For now our supply routes through Laos and Cambodia are safe.": [
"Scenario/NVC06_bv.TXT"
],
"Turn 4 saw my best Tigre Helo unit ambushed by a DK-9.  Tempation to reload again.  The 13 points were whittled down to 2.  I attempted to run some wild weasel attacks against the AD unit, and got savaged by three AD units.  My usual tactic of alternating attacks on multiple AD units didn't work.  My German Eurofighter Typhoons were taking horrific losses and sometimes going home at only 10% of their original strength.  So I said my last rites for the Tigre and hit the end turn button.  The Tigre was somehow magically spared.  So I retreated him south and parked him next to my RAH-66 which is down to 1 point of strength.": [
"Scenario/ns4PlayNotes.txt"
],
"Turn 7 saw my Challenger III deliver the coup de grace.": [
"Scenario/ns4PlayNotes.txt"
],
"Two other triggers provided more air missions, and yet another trigger increased the experience level on my Leopards.": [
