],
"With South Korea declaring its neutrality for the duration of this conflict, we have implemented Plan Red: the neutralization of Russia as a precursor to the ultimate goal, Southeast Asia. Hoping to refocus its population from its internal chaos, Russia has done us a favor by aligning itself with America and her allies. Our modern Chinese army should soon teach the decadent Russian State a lesson in ancient Chinese warfare.": [
